{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0026-s004", "text": "Barnet lär sig även sociala färdigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0026-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.299041748046875, "generation_seconds": 8.295673574088141, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0026-s005", "text": "Barnet får stöd i att lära sig det finska eller svenska språket, om hans/hennes modersmål är ett annat språk.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0026-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.264761904761905, "peak": 0.324920654296875, "generation_seconds": 20.94511578208767, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0026-s006", "text": "Om barnet behöver, kan hen även få specialundervisning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0026-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.283355712890625, "generation_seconds": 11.124365712981671, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0027-s001", "text": "Daghemmet är ändå inte en skola.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0027-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.29608154296875, "generation_seconds": 6.063447545981035, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0027-s002", "text": "Barnen studerar inte skolämnen och har inte lektioner.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0027-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.250640869140625, "generation_seconds": 9.050991695839912, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0028-s001", "text": "Barnen äter tre måltider under dagen: frukost, lunch och mellanmål.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0028-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.130068027210885, "peak": 0.2685546875, "generation_seconds": 10.408736129058525, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0028-s002", "text": "Om ditt barn har en specialdiet ska du berätta om det för lärarna i småbarnspedagogiken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0028-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.329833984375, "generation_seconds": 16.305379200028256, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0029-s001", "text": "I småbarnspedagogiken beaktas familjens religion eller livsåskådning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013934928301+0000-6/hb-c08-u0029-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.34197998046875, "generation_seconds": 13.176623403094709, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
